          "description": "Get Redfin Property Details\n\nFetches the full Redfin property page by URL. Returns address, list/sold price, price history, Redfin Estimate, beds/baths, square footage, lot size, year built, property type, HOA, days on market, school ratings, tax history, listing agent, full description, photos, walk/transit/bike scores, and nearby comparables. Use for CMA reports, investor due-diligence, valuation models, listing enrichment, and powering buyer-assistant agents with verified property facts.",
          "is_mutating": false,
          "property_keys": [
            "url"
          ],
          "required_keys": [],
